Recorder: {
	FirstMeet: {
		1: Pleased to meet you. I'm {0}, currently seeking certain “Records of Events”. Interested in lending a hand?
		2: Is there a reward?
		3:
			'''
			Of course—bring them back and I'll turn the copies into practical little tools. Interested?
			Oh, and consider this an advance payment to make your search easier.
			'''
	}

	StandardDialogue1: One day, people will tell tales of {0}...
	StandardDialogue2: When the heavens had yet to fall, all the precious wisdom of the mortal world could be preserved before it was lost... after death
	StandardDialogue3: I once worked at the Bureau. They called my kind of field assignment a vacation
	StandardDialogue4: My job is to hunt down those scattered Records of Events. If you find any, be sure to come find me
	// Dialogue when holding a special item
	AliceInWonderlandUnlocked: Wonderland... I haven't even finished touring the present world; before the journey was half over, the present world was remade
	DonQuijoteDeLaManchaUnlocked: What a wonderful place—giants, armies, sorcerers, even dragons and princesses. Ready to write your own legend?
	LittlePrinceUnlocked: If you tame me, we shall need each other. Though my taming fee is steep—about 591 platinum
	TheOldManAndTheSeaUnlocked: A man can be destroyed but not defeated. But if a slime destroys you, maybe it's time to start over
	TheoryOfFreedomUnlocked: You'd give your heart too? Oh... I'm just joking. Put that thing away
	WarAndPeaceUnlocked: Cats are troublesome, especially once they get tangled up with quantum mechanics
	TheInterpretationOfDreamsUnlocked: Strictly speaking, I don't have dreams. Give it up—why are you staring at me? It's the truth
	TheAdventureofSherlockHolmesUnlocked: Mr. Holmes never compromises with evil; not even 1% of it would be left
	TheoryofJusticeUnlocked: “Ignorance is justice” isn't quite what I meant... It seems my humor was lost on you
	EmeraldTabletUnlocked: My alchemy is limited—only Record Alchemy came naturally to me... Care for some copies?
	LordOfTheFliesUnlocked: Lord of the Flies probably doesn't mind me copying the transcript. He never agreed, but I never let him find out
	TheTaleOfTheHeikeUnlocked: The deeds of the gods are no different from this record—after the utmost glory comes congealing, decline and dusk, and at last... a plunge into the abyss
	CompendiumOfMateriaMedicaUnlocked: “Don't step on my herb garden,” said {0}, studying herbs while the town was under siege
	// Dialogue when the pet slime is found
	PetFoundDialogue:
		'''
		Thanks for bringing it back. It does love to wander off
		As a token of thanks, this gun is yours. Don't worry, I have plenty more
		'''
	// Dialogue when holding an unlocked item
	FaustUnlocking: The book in your hand is Faust. It seems we've already met elsewhere
	AliceInWonderlandUnlocking: Falling down the rabbit hole, drinking shrinking potions... a rather inefficient way to travel
	DonQuijoteDeLaManchaUnlocking: I must warn you—this one has a record of encouraging its holder to charge at windmills...
	LittlePrinceUnlocking: I'd guess you mistook a rose for Abigail...
	TheOldManAndTheSeaUnlocking: Coming back with half a fish tail might be a bit hard. Tell you what, coming home unscathed counts as success
	TheoryOfFreedomUnlocking: Maybe this can bring freedom? You'll have to think it over yourself
	WarAndPeaceUnlocking: The other half of that bad cat? The old tortoise would be delighted, if he's still alive...
	TheInterpretationOfDreamsUnlocking: It tries to impose order on chaos—admirable, much like trying to line up slimes in neat rows
	LordOfTheFliesUnlocking: Lord of the Flies probably doesn't mind me copying the transcript. He never agreed, but I never let him find out
	TheTaleOfTheHeikeUnlocking: The prosperous must decline, the living must perish... This record dwells on “decline” with particular... obsession.
	CompendiumOfMateriaMedicaUnlocking: This must be the notes of some Eastern sovereign of herbs—two hours on monarchs and ministers, on the harmony of the seven emotions. I've never transcribed a more tedious Record of Events
	// Collection quest rewards
	TheAdventureofSherlockHolmesUnlocking: Mr. Holmes can help you notice the details everyone else overlooks
	TheoryofJusticeUnlocking: I've sewn the veil of ignorance into a cloak. Fits you? It won't be altered either way
	EmeraldTabletUnlocking: This age no longer needs the One, though it's decent enough as an introduction to alchemy
	// Happiness-related lines
	Homeless: A chair and a workbench are enough; a jail cell is fine too. I just want somewhere to rest
	FarfromHome: Seems I've wandered too far... I can't find my way back at all
	FewNeighbor: It's a bit too quiet for comfort. Maybe I should suggest moving a few neighbors in
	CrowdedNeighbor: Sound has nowhere to go here—it always drifts into my ears. Perhaps it's too crowded
	NearOcean: Ocean, sand, sunshine, and the gentle sea breeze. Everything is perfect beyond words
	InUnderworld: It's so hot here it makes my head spin; the dreadful imagery of the Underworld is nothing compared to it
	CloseToNurse: I like the <Nurse Name>. She's the only one I know who can wrap bandages faster than she talks nonsense
	CloseToPartygirl: The <Party Girl Name> always invites me to her parties. Should I say the cake tastes decent?
	CloseToAngler: I like the ocean, but not the smell of fish. Unfortunately the <Angler Name> is the exact opposite
	NeutralHappiness: This place is decent enough... if you ignore the little annoyances
	// Idle chatter about other NPCs
	GuideDialogue: "{0} seems suspicious. Have you ever wondered why he knows so much?"
	AnglerDialogue: A thick smell of fish... what has {0} dragged back this time?
	PirateDialogue:
		'''
		I once heard {0} tell how pirates deal with traitors—
		they bind them with stones and sink them into the sea
		Ever considered trying that on {1}?
		It would let him get along better with the fish
		'''
	PrincessDialogue: "{0} always pesters me for stories. I'm happy to oblige, but some tales aren't quite suitable for little ears......"
	NinaBubble: ‹Nina›:
	MysteryBubble: ‹???›:
	Charlie1: Looks like someone left home without a torch?
	Charlie2: What a forgetful fellow
	Charlie3: Hey, you're not doing this on purpose, are you?
	Charlie4: This isn't fun
	Charlie5: ......
	Charlie6: Annihilation Rounds are all gone. Good luck
	CheatAh: Hm?
	CheatWhat: What are you sneaking there?
	CrystalFull: It seems you've hit your limit. If you don't mind, could you spare some for me?
	CrystalGive: Just hand it to me when we talk
	TuningHello: Hello? Can you hear me?
	TuningLink: Looks like we're connected? The framework isn't that complicated
	TuningEvening: Good evening, {0}... wait, why do you look like you've seen a ghost? This isn't that hard
}

DreamSlime: {
	Chatter_1: Blubber blubber
	Chatter_2: Boing?
	Chatter_3: *Seems to be daydreaming*
}
